WEBVTT

00:37.662 --> 00:41.916
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

00:50.467 --> 00:51.634
What is this place?

00:55.305 --> 00:57.140
Let me out of here. Please?

00:57.223 --> 00:58.641
Please take me with you.

00:59.225 --> 01:00.393
Please!

01:07.025 --> 01:08.068
Please help me.

01:11.112 --> 01:12.447
Don't come close.

01:16.117 --> 01:19.037
I might end up attacking you.

01:19.120 --> 01:20.914
How are you here?

01:20.997 --> 01:22.874
So get away from me, please.

01:23.750 --> 01:24.751
Please!

01:36.805 --> 01:37.806
Tae-sang!

01:56.908 --> 01:58.034
You're awake.

01:59.536 --> 02:00.787
What is this?

02:02.038 --> 02:04.124
I'd like to hear what happened yesterday.

02:05.041 --> 02:06.918
Who did you meet in that old factory?

02:12.173 --> 02:13.633
Where are the others?

02:14.801 --> 02:16.511
Call Yong-gil for me first.

02:17.053 --> 02:18.972
Mr. Kwon is in critical condition.

02:21.516 --> 02:24.769
He sustained a severe head injury,
which led to a brain hemorrhage.

02:25.395 --> 02:27.772
He's currently in the ICU
after emergency surgery.

02:29.899 --> 02:31.276
And where's the ICU?

02:32.068 --> 02:34.070
I have to see him first. Uncuff me.

02:34.154 --> 02:35.363
Not right now.

02:35.446 --> 02:38.700
I need to see for myself what happened
and what condition he's in!

02:40.702 --> 02:41.744
Take this off now.

02:42.579 --> 02:44.247
I'm Yong-gil's guardian, okay?

02:44.330 --> 02:47.750
We found a weapon that we suspect
had been used at the scene.

02:48.334 --> 02:50.837
We only found traces of two people on it.

02:51.421 --> 02:53.923
Hair and blood
seemingly belonging to Mr. Kwon,

02:54.716 --> 02:56.759
and your fingerprints, Mr. Jang.

02:58.136 --> 02:59.304
What are you saying?

02:59.387 --> 03:03.433
You two were the only ones there,
and based on evidence and circumstances,

03:03.975 --> 03:08.605
there is a high possibility
that you're the one who attacked Mr. Kwon.

03:08.688 --> 03:10.857
Don't be ridiculous!

03:13.193 --> 03:15.278
Why would I do such a thing to him?

03:15.361 --> 03:16.905
Was it because of money?

03:16.988 --> 03:17.822
What?

03:17.906 --> 03:20.283
I heard Bugang Company had a lot of debt.

03:20.366 --> 03:21.993
Do you want to start from there?

03:22.076 --> 03:23.328
Look here, Detective.

03:23.411 --> 03:25.872
Who's the woman that was with you?

03:25.955 --> 03:27.081
What's her deal?

03:28.374 --> 03:31.794
Is she the one who murdered
Madam Na and Oh Ki-hoon?

03:34.839 --> 03:35.673
No.

03:35.757 --> 03:38.635
If not, how is she connected
to the serial killer?

03:38.718 --> 03:40.762
There's no connection whatsoever!

03:40.845 --> 03:43.890
Then tell me what exactly happened there.

03:46.476 --> 03:47.644
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

03:53.733 --> 03:54.609
Hey!

03:55.235 --> 03:56.527
Stay with me!

03:57.153 --> 03:58.821
Wake up!

03:59.864 --> 04:01.241
Open your eyes!

04:02.116 --> 04:04.035
Hey!

04:13.419 --> 04:17.340
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN A PRETENSE OF VIRTUE AND VICE

04:17.423 --> 04:21.135
EPISODE 4
THE OTHER SIDE

04:22.637 --> 04:29.018
Is it consciousness or the subconscious
that rules over a person?

04:38.903 --> 04:40.989
What changes fate?

04:41.489 --> 04:46.327
Is it a routine
that is repeated day after day?

04:47.036 --> 04:51.082
Or is it unforeseen coincidence
and hardship?

04:55.545 --> 04:59.841
What is it that defines
the kind of person we are?

05:01.009 --> 05:02.677
Is it disposition?

05:03.428 --> 05:06.180
Or is it ability?

05:13.479 --> 05:17.317
That would depend on the person,
would it not?

05:17.400 --> 05:20.570
Why would it depend on the person?

05:21.446 --> 05:24.615
Because every individual
is quite different.

05:24.699 --> 05:27.702
They all transform in unpredictable ways.

05:27.785 --> 05:30.121
It's not because they are different.

05:30.955 --> 05:32.707
It is because they are imperfect.

05:33.708 --> 05:39.964
Most humans are neither here nor there.

05:41.507 --> 05:47.764
They are but imperfect beings
placed on the borderline.

05:47.847 --> 05:54.020
It may appear as though humans
are ceaselessly seeking life's answers,

05:54.103 --> 05:55.980
but in truth,

05:56.064 --> 06:01.361
they only strive to resolve
the anxiety in themselves.

06:03.279 --> 06:04.697
Therefore,

06:04.781 --> 06:11.746
it is fundamentally impossible
for a human being to hold good intentions.

06:13.623 --> 06:19.379
They make selfish choices
for themselves and themselves only

06:20.838 --> 06:24.759
from the beginning to the very end.

06:27.053 --> 06:33.267
That is why our work
carries so much significance.

06:34.977 --> 06:37.146
And that is why

06:38.648 --> 06:45.405
we must continue
to move forward and evolve.

06:47.448 --> 06:53.913
We do not have time to waste
on failure like this.

06:55.456 --> 06:59.127
I apologize.
We will intensify our efforts.

07:00.461 --> 07:05.299
I'd like you to bring that person back.

07:08.428 --> 07:12.390
But Lady Maeda, he's already--

07:12.473 --> 07:14.267
Bring him back.

07:18.312 --> 07:19.188
Yes, ma'am.

08:00.271 --> 08:01.397
Detective Noh.

08:02.315 --> 08:03.816
How's he doing so far?

08:04.609 --> 08:06.110
He's having a total breakdown.

08:06.777 --> 08:09.780
He caused a scene at first,
demanding to see Kwon Yong-gil,

08:09.864 --> 08:13.743
but now he's just lying down
without doing or saying anything.

08:14.243 --> 08:15.411
What did the doctor say?

08:15.912 --> 08:19.582
His injury isn't that severe,
so he'll be discharged by this afternoon.

08:19.665 --> 08:22.752
Okay, then get him discharged
and bring him straight to the station.

08:22.835 --> 08:24.170
I have so many questions.

08:24.754 --> 08:26.130
Yes, sir.

08:32.720 --> 08:35.473
What do I need to do
to get Jang Ho-jae discharged today?

08:35.556 --> 08:37.934
Please wait. Let me ask his doctor.

09:06.879 --> 09:07.838
Keep it down.

09:09.590 --> 09:10.508
I'm here to help.

09:19.100 --> 09:20.268
Wait, how did this…

09:48.296 --> 09:51.549
We're done searching outside, Captain.
Nothing seems worth noting.

09:51.632 --> 09:53.384
- What are you doing?
- Give me a hand.

09:55.970 --> 09:57.054
Yes, got it.

10:00.308 --> 10:01.892
"Nitrogen."

10:01.976 --> 10:03.394
What is this?

10:05.855 --> 10:08.149
It says "Jeonseung Bio."

10:08.774 --> 10:09.609
Jeonseung Biotech.

10:09.692 --> 10:11.360
- Jeonseung Biotech?
- Yes.

10:14.280 --> 10:17.033
Let's get out of here first.
I have a lot to tell you.

10:17.116 --> 10:18.534
Are you kidding me, asshole?

10:19.285 --> 10:21.078
You can't fool me twice.

10:24.206 --> 10:25.458
Don't you want to find her?

11:35.277 --> 11:39.240
The doctor will be right down.
Please wait in the patient's room.

11:39.323 --> 11:40.658
Okay, thank you.

11:57.258 --> 11:59.343
The suspect has escaped. Call for backup.

12:09.145 --> 12:11.021
INTENSIVE CARE UNIT

12:16.360 --> 12:18.028
Upstairs, quickly!

12:37.423 --> 12:38.883
Mr. Kwon Yong-gil's guardian?

12:38.966 --> 12:41.594
Please put on a mask
and sanitize your hands.

12:42.094 --> 12:43.679
You'll be given five minutes.

12:44.638 --> 12:47.808
He's still unconscious.
You'll have to see him and come right out.

12:47.892 --> 12:49.935
So what happened? Have you found him yet?

12:50.019 --> 12:52.021
Forensics. I found this upstairs.

12:52.104 --> 12:55.149
We are combing through
the whole hospital right now.

12:55.775 --> 12:57.193
We'll keep looking.

12:58.444 --> 13:00.196
Goddamn it!

13:14.460 --> 13:15.294
Yong-gil.

13:17.505 --> 13:19.048
Why did you do that?

13:22.009 --> 13:22.927
For what?

13:25.054 --> 13:26.931
I need to know at least something.

13:32.561 --> 13:34.313
We received a call from the ICU.

13:34.396 --> 13:36.982
Apparently, Kwon's guardian
just came to see him.

13:47.576 --> 13:48.661
Don't go.

13:51.914 --> 13:53.249
Don't go.

13:55.459 --> 13:56.877
Don't go.

13:58.128 --> 13:59.588
How are you feeling?

13:59.672 --> 14:02.550
Can you hear me? It's me, Ho-jae.

14:03.133 --> 14:04.218
Don't go.

14:05.678 --> 14:08.097
Don't go back.

14:10.933 --> 14:12.101
Keep living

14:13.644 --> 14:14.728
as Ho-jae.

14:17.356 --> 14:18.691
Just like now.

14:36.458 --> 14:37.793
Damn it.

15:21.253 --> 15:22.755
This is her scan.

15:23.589 --> 15:27.843
Let me shade in this region here
for a better look.

15:38.896 --> 15:42.650
The way the Najin has settled down
is similar to that of Seung-jo's.

15:42.733 --> 15:45.027
When a Najin enters a body as a larva,

15:45.110 --> 15:47.446
it latches on
nearer to the top of the head.

15:47.529 --> 15:50.074
But these two have settled in the back.

15:50.157 --> 15:53.702
As Seung-jo received
a mature Najin from his mother,

15:53.786 --> 15:58.457
it is highly likely
that it was the same case for her as well.

16:13.555 --> 16:15.140
It won't open.

16:18.852 --> 16:19.687
Who's there?

16:23.440 --> 16:26.068
Do you know where we are
or what it is they do here?

16:32.825 --> 16:34.743
Are you all right? Hey!

16:40.416 --> 16:41.834
They said they would cure me.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.588
They said if I drank it…

16:48.841 --> 16:51.468
I wouldn't have to live
with a disability anymore.

16:54.096 --> 16:55.556
It's a simple experiment.

16:56.724 --> 16:59.977
You just have to empty
the glass of water in front of you.

17:00.853 --> 17:04.898
Then you'll immediately receive
ten million won in your bank accounts.

17:10.738 --> 17:11.572
Excuse me.

17:12.406 --> 17:13.240
Yes?

17:13.323 --> 17:15.284
If the experiment succeeds,

17:16.577 --> 17:18.871
will my leg be cured for sure?

17:21.665 --> 17:23.792
You have infantile paralysis, I see.

17:25.044 --> 17:25.961
That's correct.

17:27.087 --> 17:28.756
If this experiment succeeds,

17:30.007 --> 17:31.842
you'll no longer live with a disability.

17:33.969 --> 17:36.930
All right, then. Let's drink up, shall we?

17:58.243 --> 18:00.037
Ten million…

18:02.414 --> 18:03.248
MY PUPPY

18:04.458 --> 18:08.128
The person you're calling is unavailable.
Leave a message after the tone.

18:13.300 --> 18:14.968
I'll no longer have a disability.

18:16.845 --> 18:18.639
You won't have to suffer because of me.

18:22.476 --> 18:23.560
Help!

18:34.947 --> 18:36.615
Please help me!

19:00.389 --> 19:02.057
They said…

19:05.227 --> 19:10.399
my leg would heal
if the experiment succeeded.

19:53.567 --> 19:57.029
Is there anything more I should know
about myself before the accident?

19:57.112 --> 20:00.490
You're much better off now
than you were before the accident.

20:00.574 --> 20:03.994
I just came to check
if all your memories really disappeared.

20:04.077 --> 20:04.995
Please…

20:05.495 --> 20:06.705
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

21:52.894 --> 21:53.770
Sir!

22:01.236 --> 22:02.154
Sir!

22:13.832 --> 22:14.750
Master Jang!

22:28.680 --> 22:32.184
Sir, what are you doing?
Aren't you going to take a photograph?

22:43.153 --> 22:45.864
You're not waiting
for the sun to set, are you?

22:55.874 --> 22:59.336
We have to take it while the sun's out.
Hurry up. I'm busy!

22:59.419 --> 23:03.173
You'll let me take a photo
on my own later, won't you?

23:03.256 --> 23:04.257
Yeong-chun.

23:04.341 --> 23:07.344
You can go to the studio
and use your own money to do that.

23:10.722 --> 23:13.683
Stop staring at us and come here already!

23:14.601 --> 23:15.977
Hurry up!

23:18.397 --> 23:19.731
Chop-chop!

23:23.318 --> 23:24.403
Come now.

24:11.199 --> 24:12.451
Here I come.

24:18.206 --> 24:19.583
All right, looking good.

24:20.125 --> 24:22.669
- Slow down!
- Sure. As you wish.

24:24.129 --> 24:27.549
Here we go now. One, two…

24:28.592 --> 24:30.427
One, two, three!

24:36.433 --> 24:38.685
Please. I said I'm fine.

24:38.768 --> 24:40.187
We're celebrating, remember?

24:41.938 --> 24:43.482
A little closer. Look friendly.

24:43.565 --> 24:46.359
Give us a smile!
They won't arrest you for smiling.

24:46.443 --> 24:48.361
Show your teeth at least!

24:49.279 --> 24:51.907
That's it. One, two, three!

25:34.950 --> 25:36.451
Do you want something to drink?

29:20.091 --> 29:20.925
Weak.

29:30.518 --> 29:32.020
Too slow, man.

29:37.776 --> 29:40.862
How are you going to find that woman
in that sorry state?

29:45.742 --> 29:48.328
Asshole. Are you going
to keep hiding like this?

29:49.454 --> 29:50.914
Does it look like I'm hiding?

29:53.458 --> 29:54.709
I'm right here, you know.

29:59.547 --> 30:00.882
It's driving you mad, huh?

30:01.633 --> 30:05.345
I'm here, but you can't see me.
When you can see me, you can't catch me.

30:05.970 --> 30:09.516
I don't listen to cowards who hide.
Come out now.

30:10.475 --> 30:11.976
Show yourself, asshole!

30:18.483 --> 30:19.317
Now what?

30:22.362 --> 30:23.196
Can you beat me?

30:29.327 --> 30:30.870
You're gonna get yourself killed.

30:36.125 --> 30:38.628
No one has ever messed with us before,

30:40.338 --> 30:41.589
except one person.

30:43.675 --> 30:44.509
That's you.

30:45.093 --> 30:46.469
Don't you miss those times?

30:47.303 --> 30:48.388
You crazy bastard!

30:55.478 --> 30:58.773
You know what I'm talking about.

31:00.733 --> 31:04.070
Your memories are coming back.
Aren't they?

31:57.206 --> 31:58.416
Don't run from anything.

31:59.584 --> 32:00.710
Look it in the eye

32:01.836 --> 32:03.087
and face it head-on.

32:03.880 --> 32:05.882
Then you'll have a real shot at winning.

32:10.887 --> 32:13.264
Those were your words, Ho-jae.

32:20.897 --> 32:21.981
You have to remember.

32:54.180 --> 32:55.264
Are you okay?

32:56.516 --> 32:57.433
Hey!

32:58.184 --> 32:59.769
Wake up!

33:00.478 --> 33:02.313
He'll stay like that for a while.

33:04.065 --> 33:07.485
Even if he gains consciousness,
he won't be able to recognize anyone.

33:07.568 --> 33:09.654
A massive craving will hit him at first.

33:14.325 --> 33:15.868
But you already know that.

33:17.704 --> 33:19.789
How long have you lived like that?

33:20.581 --> 33:22.417
Tell me where I am first.

33:22.500 --> 33:24.168
As far as I can remember…

33:26.295 --> 33:29.215
the Najin was never leaked to the outside.

33:29.298 --> 33:31.134
Just what on earth are you bastards?

33:32.802 --> 33:36.472
What kind of bastards are you
to be doing such a terrible thing?

33:37.140 --> 33:38.558
How did you survive?

33:41.060 --> 33:43.813
How long have you lived
without being under control?

33:43.896 --> 33:46.190
Are there more of our kind out there
besides you?

33:53.489 --> 33:54.657
Don't tell me…

33:58.828 --> 34:00.329
this is Ongseong Hospital.

34:07.211 --> 34:08.212
Is it?

34:10.006 --> 34:13.760
That hospital closed
when the Greater East Asia War ended.

34:15.511 --> 34:17.764
Most of the building
was destroyed during the war,

34:17.847 --> 34:21.100
and Jeonseung Biotech was built
on top of its ruins.

34:24.979 --> 34:28.149
Its founders are Lady Maeda
and the former chairman, Kato.

34:30.610 --> 34:34.113
Chairman Shin Ji-oh, his son,
has currently succeeded him.

34:41.162 --> 34:44.082
So it's not over, then.

34:45.500 --> 34:47.085
This hell.

34:48.086 --> 34:49.337
Now, answer me.

34:53.216 --> 34:54.467
Who are you?

35:56.154 --> 35:57.029
Out.

38:28.556 --> 38:29.557
Make your choice.

38:30.349 --> 38:32.435
Either go back to the man you used to be,

38:33.811 --> 38:34.729
or…

38:37.440 --> 38:38.774
die here like this.

38:41.110 --> 38:43.571
Don't go back.

38:44.905 --> 38:46.198
Keep living

38:47.908 --> 38:48.826
as Ho-jae.

38:51.412 --> 38:52.913
Just like now.

38:56.667 --> 38:57.585
Come back.

39:00.171 --> 39:01.213
Be it Ho-jae…

39:03.215 --> 39:04.550
or Tae-sang, I don't care.

39:06.761 --> 39:08.679
Go back to the man I once knew.

39:13.517 --> 39:14.852
Let's go back to those times.

39:16.145 --> 39:17.021
Okay?

40:43.983 --> 40:45.401
Long time no see…

40:47.903 --> 40:49.238
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.
